Z||000000||fiero_nightmare||10-11-2001||02:05 PM||||i just replaced the engine on my 85 GT and it is almost done except for a few things. the main problem i am having is i cant figure out where one vacume line goes to. it is the big one that hookes into the back of the plenum. i cant find where it bolts to or what it hooks up to. anyone have any idea's?<P>------------------<BR>my 85 GT pics <P>http://communities.msn.com/russcars/85fierogt.msnw||||reg||1
Z||000001||88CoupeV6||10-11-2001||03:05 PM||||Is it a rubber line that plugs in between the plenums underneath? if it is that it is the PVC valve line. It is metal and comes out centered over the rear valve cover it goes to a line on the firewall for the power brake booster. Hope that helps  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
