Z||000004||fiero_nightmare||10-11-2001||06:26 PM||||thank you both for the help. it was the brake booster line. too bad i already had the upper plenum on the engine.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>i had to cut a slot in the bracket so the bolt would go through the hole because i could not get the bolt off the engine and i didnt feel like taking the plenum off again.<P>------------------<BR>my 85 GT pics <P>http://communities.msn.com/russcars/85fierogt.msnw||||reg||1
